    "Connect your piano or MainStage MIDI output. Played notes appear on the live piano — including C2 and C♯2. Optionally assign foot-pedal trigger notes below, or use CC 116/117 for hands-free chord changes." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the MIDI settings screen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect your piano or MainStage MIDI output. Played notes appear on the live piano — including C2 and C♯2. Optionally assign foot-pedal trigger notes below, or use CC 116/117 for hands-free chord changes."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conecta la salida MIDI de tu piano o MainStage. Las notas tocadas aparecen en el piano en vivo — incluidos C2 y C♯2. Opcionalmente asigna abajo notas de pedales, o usa CC 116/117 para cambiar acordes sin manos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connectez la sortie MIDI de votre piano ou de MainStage. Les notes jouées apparaissent sur le piano live — y compris C2 et C♯2. Vous pouvez aussi assigner ci-dessous des notes de pédale, ou utiliser les CC 116/117 pour changer d’accord sans les mains."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conecte a saída MIDI do piano ou do MainStage. As notas tocadas aparecem no piano ao vivo — inclusive C2 e C♯2. Opcionalmente, atribua notas de gatilho do pedal abaixo, ou use CC 116/117 para trocar acordes sem as mãos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect your piano or MainStage MIDI output. Use foot pedal notes C1 (36) / C♯1 (37) or CC 116/117 to change chords hands-free." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect your piano or MainStage MIDI output. Use foot pedal notes C1 (36) / C♯1 (37) or CC 116/117 to change chords hands-free."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conecta la salida MIDI de tu piano o MainStage. Usa pedal C1 (36) / C♯1 (37) o CC 116/117 para cambiar acordes sin manos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connectez la sortie MIDI de votre piano ou de MainStage. Utilisez les notes de pédale C1 (36) / C♯1 (37) ou les CC 116/117 pour changer d’accord sans les mains."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conecte a saída MIDI do piano ou do MainStage. Use as notas do pedal C1 (36) / C♯1 (37) ou CC 116/117 para trocar acordes sem as mãos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
