    "You decide when to use it. Play naturally — the app listens, then asks you to confirm tempo and groove before drums start." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the Solo Accompaniment feature.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You decide when to use it. Play naturally — the app listens, then asks you to confirm tempo and groove before drums start."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tú decides cuándo usarlo. Toca con naturalidad — la app escucha y luego te pide confirmar tempo y groove antes de que empiece la batería."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous décidez quand l’utiliser. Jouez naturellement — l’app écoute, puis vous demande de confirmer le tempo et le groove avant de démarrer la batterie."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você decide quando usar. Toque naturalmente — o app escuta e depois pede para confirmar o tempo e o groove antes de iniciar a bateria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
